ready a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229548,"global_rank":113730,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19697},{"name":"nonabelian/leapy","owner":"nonabelian","html_url":"https://github.com/nonabelian/leapy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"BETA: Real-time inference from scalable machine learning in Python","topics":["dask","dask-ml","data-science","inference","machine-learning","pipeline","pipelines","real-time","realtime"],"score":229548,"global_rank":230303,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19698},{"name":"Avynn/Cat-GAN","owner":"Avynn","html_url":"https://github.com/Avynn/Cat-GAN","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"a generative adverserial network created to identify and generate cats","topics":[],"score":229520,"global_rank":113773,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19699},{"name":"bcov77/pipeline_for_diversify","owner":"bcov77","html_url":"https://github.com/bcov77/pipeline_for_diversify","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229520,"global_rank":113775,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19700}]